THE SOURCE DATA
---------------

data/raw/qcl_2025-12-31.zip is a verbatim copy of a FAOSTAT bulk download and is NOT
covered by the above. It is the property of the Food and Agriculture Organization of
the United Nations and is licensed CC BY 4.0.

  FAO. 2025. Production: Crops and livestock products. FAOSTAT.
  Licence: CC BY 4.0. https://www.fao.org/faostat/en/#data/QCL

If you redistribute that file, or figures computed from it, that attribution has to
travel with it. The archive is included rather than downloaded on demand because the
FAO bulk endpoint serves only the current release: without the file, the SHA-256 pin in
data/raw/manifest.json cannot be checked against anything.

data/geo/ne_50m_admin_0_countries.geojson is Natural Earth, which is public domain.

  https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/
